  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 169, Number 129 (Wednesday, July 26, 2023)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Ms. LEE of California:\nH.R. 4919.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle I, Section 8, Clause 18 of the Constitution\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nThis bill creates a self-adjusting wealth tax that is\ndetermined based off the median household wealth as\ndetermined by the U.S. Treasury.\n[Page H4032]\n</pre>",
